    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Burnt othur fumes smell of scorched hair and wet copper.</p><p><em>Inhaled Poison</em></p><p>A creature subjected to Burnt Othur Fumes must succeed on a DC 13 Constitution saving throw or take 10 (3d6) Poison damage, and it must repeat the save at the start of each of its turns. On each successive failed save, the creature takes 3 (1d6) Poison damage. After three successful saves, the poison ends.</p>",
